message: "If you use these scripts, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Analysis scripts for vitamin D3-related genes in Atlantic salmon"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, small inputs and results for the identification, protein phylogeny and multi-tissue expression
  profiling of 16 vitamin D3-related genes in Atlantic salmon (Salmo salar), and for the figures and supplementary
  tables of the accompanying manuscript.
